{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["But had the nations been wise, they would say: How could one of us pursue a thousand — of Israel, as we were accustomed to do with them — were it not that their Rock delivered them into our hands because they sinned against Him? And so it says above: הצור תמים פעלו."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {0 "The lemma reflected in the comment is ולו חכמו (Deut. 32:29), vocalized by Rashbam as a conditional: 'had they been wise' (אלו חכמו)."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:39:52.316731630Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}